WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.929 --> 00:00:04.569
Devil fruits are the most important power
in one piece, but have you ever thought: “wow,

00:00:04.569 --> 00:00:08.420
it would be awesome if we saw THIS POWER in
the story?”

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:16.080
Well, I had the very same idea and asked you
all to submit your wildest, most powerful

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.620
devil fruits that would break the one piece
world.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:26.599
And you won’t believe how hard it was to
sort through almost TWO THOUSAND submissions

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:33.500
to pick out just fifteen of the coolest devil
fruit powers you will ever see.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.520
But let’s first start with just how completely
insane this contest developed.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:44.200
Because after the VERY FIRST MINUTE that the
contest was open, I already saw three banger

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:50.489
devil fruit ideas, I just knew this was going
to be a MASSIVE CHALLENGE to just pick fifteen.

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:55.340
And I also have to give a HUGE, HUGE thank
you to everyone from all over the world who

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.980
submitted your devil fruit.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:02.030
I just loved to see this amazing community
come together in such an awesome way.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.030
In the end though, after I looked through
every submission, and I mean every single

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.030
one, and narrowed the list down to the top
100, plus a separate list of the best funny/meme

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.030
submissions which you might see in a future
video.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:06.030
Then I spent even more time looking through
the top 100, and ended up ranking the top

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:07.030
fifteen fruits based on how completely awesome
they are, but also still made sense as a reasonable

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:08.030
power in the One Piece World.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:09.030
However, I do have to be honest in that I
did not take any submissions that were actually

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.030
already fruits in the story.

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:15.850
And if there were repeat devil fruit submissions
- like the over 100 water fruits, the 42 blood

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:21.290
fruits, and the 37 air/wind fruits - then
I just had to pick the submission with the

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:24.549
best explanation of powers and limitations.

00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:31.799
And speaking of limitations, any submission
that was just stupidly broken with absolutely

00:01:31.799 --> 00:01:37.360
no restrictions - like the Universe fruit
that lets you do literally anything you want

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.860
- I had to throw out as well because there
is no devil fruit in the story that doesn’t

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:46.290
have some restriction or downside to its powers.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:51.000
And the last disclaimer is that this video
is not JUST about strong fighting fruits,

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:57.939
but also includes ones that are stupidly useful
in other ways.

00:01:57.939 --> 00:02:07.430
And the perfect example of this is the Boturo
Boturo no mi, submitted by Martin, which has

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.420
my favorite devil fruit design in this entire
ranking.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:15.680
I mean just look at this incredibly creative
ship in the bottle theme!

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.800
Now, what does this fruit do?

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:26.209
Well, it gives you the ability to shrink anything
and keep it inside a bottle.

00:02:26.209 --> 00:02:30.430
Which doesn’t sound all that special, but
let me explain.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:35.220
Imagine you are stuck at the Red Line, but
don’t want to go underwater to fishman island?

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:40.099
Well, with this fruit you can just put your
ship in a bottle and carry it over the Red

00:02:40.099 --> 00:02:41.430
Line in your pocket.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:46.080
Or imagine that you want to do a sneak attack
on Marineford.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:51.290
With this fruit you can literally keep an
entire army in a bottle, and when you are

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.920
ready to fight, smashing the bottle will release
the entire army.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:03:01.790
Which is simply incredible for sneaking around
and transporting anything, but it also has

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.390
some OP combat abilities as well.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:11.650
For example, you trap fire or lightning in
a bottle and then release it to defeat an

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:12.650
opponent.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:19.530
So yeah, truly a creative, overpowered, and
incredibly useful fruit.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:23.739
Plus again, that design *Chef’s kiss.* Well
done, Martin.

00:03:23.739 --> 00:03:30.900
However, even that insane ability is not as
useful as the Senti-Senti no mi, which was

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.890
submitted by Musa from India.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:39.519
Now this power is absurdly broken, and if
used by the right person, could completely

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:42.000
tear down the entire World Government.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.020
That’s because the ability of the Senti-Senti
no mi lets you learn everything about a person

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.620
or object by simply touching it.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.569
And when I say everything, I mean EVERYTHING.

00:03:52.569 --> 00:03:57.510
Now, to perfectly demonstrate how broken this
fruit is, let’s say you ate this fruit and

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.110
then touched a poneglyph.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:06.269
Well you would now know what it says, who
made it, when and where it was made, and possibly

00:04:06.269 --> 00:04:09.540
even where the others like it were placed
around the world.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:15.230
Or if you touched a world noble, then you
would learn ALL THEIR SECRETS, including information

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:18.650
that the world government would never want
you to know.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:24.600
So yeah, if that isn’t an insanely OP power
in a pirate-treasure hunt story, then I don’t

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.600
know what is.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:29.539
But that’s not all because in combat you
could use this fruit to learn all of your

00:04:29.539 --> 00:04:36.259
opponent's weaknesses and come up with the
best way to beat them.

00:04:36.259 --> 00:04:42.600
However, even the incredible knowledge you’d
gain from the Senti fruit doesn’t compare

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:46.580
to the god-tier abilities of this next fruit.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:52.870
That’s because with the powers of Zac-the-soda’s
Snail Snail - Model Den Den Mushi, you can

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:56.820
instantly communicate with people all over
the world.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:01.820
Which, you might be saying, “well normal
den den mushis can already do that”, but

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:08.820
this power lets you communicate with literally
anyone without ever needing the snail phone.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:13.440
Which let's be honest, how many times during
battle are you going to pause to pick up the

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.440
phone?

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:22.310
And this fruit truly shines with the ability
to have group calls inside of your head that

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:28.530
would let you instantly coordinate with your
entire squad to strategize during an all out

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:29.530
massive war.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:33.190
I mean just imagine how useful this power
would have been when the straw hats were lost

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:37.660
in the forest during Skypiea, or during the
chaotic battle of Onigashima where there were

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:40.370
literally people fighting all over the castle.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:45.699
In fact, this power would be perfect for a
strategist like Sanji, who could organize

00:05:45.699 --> 00:05:49.020
everyone to fight in the best possible locations.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:57.020
Which again isn’t a super broken combat
fruit on its own, but in a world as big as

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:05.319
one piece, instant communication would be
one of the most important abilities

00:06:05.319 --> 00:06:12.530
This next fruit though is 100% a fruit that
I guarantee you’ve never heard of.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:18.040
That’s because&nbsp; Hikiko from Italy submitted
one of my personal favorites in the ranking,

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:22.750
the Game Game no mi.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:29.940
And now, we had many reality bending submissions,
but this one is SO INTERESTING that I just

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.740
had to include it on the list.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:38.550
Basically, this fruit allows you to turn yourself
into a video game character and treat the

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:42.160
world like your own personal RPG adventure
game.

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:47.349
That means you can pause everyone during battle
to give yourself time to think, you can keep

00:06:47.349 --> 00:06:53.340
a hidden inventory of up to 999 items, and
you can even save your progress up to three

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:56.720
times and return to that save point.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.040
I mean come on, who wouldn’t want this fruit???

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:06.440
And just imagine you are about to get absolutely
crushed by Kaido, well you can quickly quit

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.970
out and restart the boss fight.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:10.970
Simple as that.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:15.750
And of course, what is a video game without
an incredible powerup system, so every time

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:22.770
you defeat an enemy you gain stat points to
level up your strength, speed, health, and

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:28.060
other abilities.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:32.310
Plus you get item drops and money for every
enemy you defeat.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:37.550
Although with any ridiculous power like this
there have to be some limitations, so you

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:40.340
can’t just restart as many times as you
like.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:44.880
There has to be a limit, like a certain number
of times per day, and every time you restart

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:49.659
you lose any exp and loot you might have gained
since your last “save”.

00:07:49.659 --> 00:07:59.620
Also, pausing during battle dramatically drains
your stamina, so it’s not like an infinite

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:05.260
time-stopping power.

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:10.909
Speaking of time fruits though, dozens of
submissions had time-based powers, but South

00:08:10.909 --> 00:08:19.289
Africa’s Hasan submitted the Chrono-Chrono
no mi, which had the best combination of super

00:08:19.289 --> 00:08:23.070
awesome time powers with reasonable limitations.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:27.450
That’s because this fruit gives the user
the ability to create time bubbles around

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.450
themselves.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:34.000
And within these bubbles they can freely speed
up or slow down time.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:38.849
Which is absolutely devastating if you are
fighting someone one on one, because while

00:08:38.849 --> 00:08:43.789
you both would be moving at the same speed
inside the bubble, you could easily confuse

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:47.060
them by changing the rate of speed at any
given time.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:51.350
And of course time would be flowing normally
outside the bubble, but if you are moving

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:56.029
super fast inside of it, then you could quickly
dash around a battlefield to avoid attacks

00:08:56.029 --> 00:08:58.710
or simply get to the other side.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:04.430
In particular, this fruit would be perfect
in a situation like the Bird Cage from Dressrosa,

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:09.220
where you could make a bubble around yourself
and Doflamingo to effectively speed up the

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:15.230
fight against the former Warlord before the
string cage did any more damage to the city.

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:18.850
Awakening this fruit could also allow you
to create bigger time bubbles, but this power

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:26.910
can also leave you pretty exhausted, so you’d
still need to be pretty strong to use it.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:33.829
Which is the exact opposite of this next fruit,
which might have the highest power ceiling

00:09:33.829 --> 00:09:38.370
but also the lowest floor of any fruit on
this ranking.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:43.160
This is the Share-Share fruit, which was submitted
by Kudi from Japan.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:47.190
And this one is a bit complex, so make sure
you’re paying attention.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:52.209
Now the base ability of the Share fruit allows
you to essentially share your physical abilities

00:09:52.209 --> 00:09:53.660
with another person.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:56.470
So you get weak, they get strong.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:10:03.620
The catch is that once that person dies, you
get BOTH power back as well as ALL THE STRENGTH

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.440
of the person you shared your power with.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:11.350
So if you are both just normal people, once
the person dies you’d get double the power

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.350
back.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:18.000
But let’s say you gave your power to someone
super strong, then once THEY DIED you’d

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.010
get all that strength back in return.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:26.269
So really over your entire life, your power
could grow an insane amount depending on how

00:10:26.269 --> 00:10:28.980
many times you share and get back your powers.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:37.500
Honestly, I’d love for a power like this
to even have an extra special ability where

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:42.339
the power of each user is transferred to the
next person who eats the fruit.

00:10:42.339 --> 00:10:45.820
So kinda like the One for All power from My
Hero Academia.

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:49.800
Which means you won’t get much power if
you’re the first person to eat the fruit,

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:55.089
but just imagine if you are the tenth person
to eat it, then well you basically have godly

00:10:55.089 --> 00:11:02.700
strength from the moment you eat the fruit.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:11.899
Now it might be crazy to say, but this next
power could make you an even deadlier weapon

00:11:11.899 --> 00:11:14.829
than any fruit that we’ve discussed so far.

00:11:14.829 --> 00:11:24.420
That’s because notRowan submitted the Dew
Dew fruit, and oh man, do I love the concept

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.420
of this fruit.

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:26.480
Let me explain.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:34.209
By touching an opponent, you can drain their
normal abilities such as speed, strength,

00:11:34.209 --> 00:11:37.070
and endurance and turn them into large drops
of liquid.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:42.300
You can take these Dew drops of power and
give those abilities to yourself, an ally,

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.950
or even an inanimate object.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:49.220
So for example, if you were fighting Luffy,
you could drain some of his insane stamina

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.779
and absorb that stamina yourself.

00:11:50.779 --> 00:11:55.980
And an awakened form of this power could even
let you take powers from inanimate objects

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:59.730
like fire, and then give those powers to another
person.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:04.740
Plus there aren’t that many downsides to
this fruit, but one that makes sense is that

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:08.100
you don’t just gain your opponent’s power
forever.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:12.040
Once you use up the amount you drained, then
it is gone.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:18.100
Strong haki users could also resist the fruit,
which I guess is the case for most devil fruits,

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:20.840
but only if they have stronger haki than you.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:26.230
If you thought that power might be incredibly
versatile, then just wait until you hear about

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:31.980
the Zodiac devil fruit submitted by FalconFig
of the United States of America.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:42.000
And with this being the only zoan in the top
fifteen you can bet it is insanely creative.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:47.280
The original idea is that the fruit would
grant you the power of one of the zodiac animals,

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:51.910
but honestly I think making this a mythical
zoan fruit could mean that you can freely

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.900
transform into any of the zodiac animals.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:58.200
And while some of these look pretty harmless,
just think about the incredible diversity

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:59.209
of powers.

00:12:59.209 --> 00:13:03.390
You can easily sneak around as a small rat
or you can blast your way through an entire

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.420
army as a massive dragon.

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:10.449
I can just imagine the rabbit having super
speed and something like the Ox being just

00:13:10.449 --> 00:13:11.980
an insanely durable tank.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:16.980
And since this is the zodiac we are talking
about, you might even get an extra power boost

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:23.430
depending on if the time of the year lines
up with the animal you are using.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:33.750
So yeah, quite an awesome power to use in
basically any situation.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:42.300
However, nothing is as powerful as Derek’s
devil fruit idea, the Sub Sub no mi, which

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:46.370
instantly lets you subscribe to the channel
for more one piece content just like this.

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:52.949
Plus there is an infinite amount of these
fruits, so go ahead… eat the fruit.

00:13:52.949 --> 00:13:58.100
This next fruit though is almost too deadly
to even put into the story.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:05.100
Because Ludwig from the Czech Republic submitted
the Kinoko Kinoko no mi, which is a logia

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:08.410
ability that turns you into mushroom spores.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.850
Yes, I said that, MUSHROOM SPORES!

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:17.100
And if you know anything about mushrooms,
well then you should know this power can be

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:20.070
absolutely lethal.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:25.279
Because as a mushroom spore person, you can
turn your body into literally billions of

00:14:25.279 --> 00:14:28.610
tiny mushroom particles that could spread
in the air.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:34.839
And if someone breathes in these spores, then
well it’s basically game over because mushrooms

00:14:34.839 --> 00:14:40.190
have a ton of insane effects.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:45.339
Some are so poisonous they can instantly kill
you, others can make you hallucinate, or even

00:14:45.339 --> 00:14:47.230
make a person fall asleep.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:52.600
Which means that you are untouchable from
close range because anyone who hits you would

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:55.940
be exposed to these tiny spores.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:15:01.209
To take this one step further, awakening this
fruit could let you turn your entire environment

00:15:01.209 --> 00:15:06.910
into mushroom spores as well, which means
a whole battlefield could instantly be a poisonous

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:09.579
minefield for anyone who gets too close.

00:15:09.579 --> 00:15:17.160
So yeah, definitely an OP ability, and one
I would love to see in the story.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:24.779
While this next fruit might not be as obviously
powerful, it is simply one of my favorite

00:15:24.779 --> 00:15:29.660
abilities in all of anime, but has never shown
up in One Piece.

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:35.300
This is the Dice Dice fruit, which yes I know
Mr. 1’s fruit has the same name, but this

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:42.120
version submitted by River from Canada involves
actual black and white dice.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.779
And wow!

00:15:43.779 --> 00:15:46.980
Let me explain how this absurd power works.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:52.620
First, the user can summon a six-sided die
which has the numbers 1-6 on the sides.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:59.220
Then they throw it out and whatever number
it lands on, that effect is instantly used.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.070
Now, what are those effects?

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:07.610
Well, I’m glad you asked because River supplied
a perfectly balanced list of awesome abilities.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:11.970
Rolling a 1 lets you blast the dice at your
opponent like a bullet.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:17.899
Rolling a 2 causes a flying wicked slash like
a curved scythe that can hit multiple opponents.

00:16:17.899 --> 00:16:24.760
A three causes damage to an opponent and any
one else within six feet, kinda like a small

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:25.760
explosion.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:30.610
A four causes a raining dance of blade-like
dice to rain down on the battlefield.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:34.029
The five instantly lowers an opponent’s
speed and stamina.

00:16:34.029 --> 00:16:40.389
And then a six makes a floating dart that
hovers around the user to attack anyone who

00:16:40.389 --> 00:16:41.940
gets near you.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:49.600
Which is all just amazingly cool if you ask
me, but of course the downside is that you

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:54.480
can’t exactly choose what power is used
at any given moment.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:58.421
There might also be a short cooldown time
before you can do your next roll, So if you

00:16:58.421 --> 00:17:03.139
really need to roll a four and rain down blades
on a bunch of opponents, you might not get

00:17:03.139 --> 00:17:07.079
it right away.

00:17:07.079 --> 00:17:14.490
Now, for this next fruit I want you to think
about the thing you want most in the world

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.490
right now.

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:17.120
Is it a huge stack of money?

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.220
A passing grade on your next exam?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:22.000
A delicious sushi roll?

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.980
Yes please for me.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:29.400
Well, with the Hoko Hoko no mi submitted by
Eli from the USA, you can create a magical

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:34.620
compass that will lead you right to whatever
you desire most.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:39.110
Just like Jack Sparrow’s compass from the
Pirates of the Caribbean.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:42.470
So yeah, finding the One Piece?

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:45.669
No problem, like at all, with this fruit.

00:17:45.669 --> 00:17:50.260
Just follow the direction the compass is pulling
you towards and you will find it eventually.

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:56.020
It could also help you find other overpowered
devil fruits to sell or give to your friends,

00:17:56.020 --> 00:18:02.380
and it even has applications in battle, such
as guiding you to find the best path to winning.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:08.510
You can even create a compass on another person,
which will guide them to what they most desire.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:14.900
But now, I know a bunch of you have been waiting
for this next ability because it was THE MOST

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:20.860
submitted devil fruit after the Water Fruit,
and that is of course the Blood Fruit.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:29.100
Which again, there were a ton of these ideas
submitted and I thank you for all of them,

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:35.570
but the option I chose was submitted by Tarush
Pathak from India because it had the best

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:39.620
description of powers along with realistic
limitations.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:48.039
And like the name says, this fruit allows
you to produce and control blood.

00:18:48.039 --> 00:18:51.470
That means that you can whip out deadly blood
slashes for long range attacks.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.630
You can make a blood sword to fight in close
combat.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:58.919
And, yes, you can even control the blood INSIDE
of another person.

00:18:58.919 --> 00:19:05.590
Which kinda creeps me out, but I guess it’s
something you all seem to enjoy.

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:11.880
But of course there have to be limits on this
simply broken ability, so for this fruit we’ll

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.669
say that you can’t make anyone kill themselves
by stopping their blood.

00:19:15.669 --> 00:19:21.169
That would just be way too evil, but you can
slow down or speed up someone’s blood to

00:19:21.169 --> 00:19:25.080
a certain extent to make them slower or to
help them heal faster.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:29.520
You could also physically control their movements,
so you can be an evil puppet master.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:33.020
Of course, controlling another person can
be overcome if the other person is strong

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:45.159
enough, so even this isn’t guaranteed to
win 

00:19:45.159 --> 00:19:48.150
you a fight, but it is still incredibly powerful.

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:53.200
Let me tell you though, if I was a devil fruit
user, I would not want to fight this next

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.580
fruit.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:20:04.250
Because at number three we have the Leech
Leech fruit submitted by Vater.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.330
And its powers are just like it sounds.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:10.510
It lets you slowly drain other people’s
powers.

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:15.900
Which is similar to the Dew fruit we discussed
earlier, except THIS ONE drains devil fruit

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.550
abilities, not just strength and speed.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:23.309
That means it is the perfect power for a long,
drawn out fight against a devil fruit user

00:20:23.309 --> 00:20:30.610
because if you can survive long enough, your
opponent will eventually get weaker and weaker

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:32.010
just by being around you.

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:38.250
A perfect example is a marathon fight against
Kaido, which if you had this fruit and could

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:46.430
survive for a long time, you might stand a
chance at taking down one of these powerhouses.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:51.299
To take it one step further, a possible awakening
for this fruit could also drain your opponent's

00:20:51.299 --> 00:20:56.110
normal strength as well, which means that
in a long fight you are almost guaranteed

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:58.059
to win.

00:20:58.059 --> 00:21:05.130
Though even the Leech fruit is not as overpowered
as this next fruit, which I’m honestly kind

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:09.320
of shocked it does not already exist in the
story.

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:15.990
That’s because Sahaj Shresth from Nepal
submitted the Yume Yume no mi, also called

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:17.120
the Dream Dream fruit.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:24.090
And this fruit is mind-blowingly useful in
SO MANY situations.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:28.570
The first power of this fruit allows you to
put someone to sleep by touching them, which

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.670
is just already ridiculously useful in a fight.

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:36.750
But that’s just the start because once your
target is asleep, you can then manipulate

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:39.150
their dream in the following ways.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:44.690
You could change the dream however you want,
which could be either incredibly enjoyable

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:47.029
or absolutely terrifying.

00:21:47.029 --> 00:21:51.150
You can also physically attack your target
in the dream world, which wouldn’t damage

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:56.650
their actual body because that’s just too
absurdly broken, but enough damage and you

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:58.510
could break their mind.

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:03.470
This power also lets you communicate through
dreams, so you can talk to an ally as long

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:05.849
as they are asleep.

00:22:05.849 --> 00:22:10.909
And to top it off, awakening this fruit could
also let the user manifest their dream creations

00:22:10.909 --> 00:22:12.350
into the real world.

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.880
Which, yeah, if you’ve ever had any wild
and crazy dreams like I have, then you should

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:23.779
know just how insane this ability actually
is.

00:22:23.779 --> 00:22:30.460
Which brings us to the number one best devil
fruit that would break the world of One Piece,

00:22:30.460 --> 00:22:34.890
which is the Play Play fruit submitted by
Joe.

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:40.370
And at first, I thought this would be just
like the Game fruit we discussed earlier,

00:22:40.370 --> 00:22:43.419
but wow was I wrong.

00:22:43.419 --> 00:22:44.419
Just listen to this.

00:22:44.419 --> 00:22:50.299
The basic power of this fruit allows you to
make any sort of game into a binding contest

00:22:50.299 --> 00:22:51.600
in the real world.

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:55.721
For example, if you are in a fight against
a super strong opponent, you can use this

00:22:55.721 --> 00:22:59.049
fruit to turn the fight into a game that decides
the outcome.

00:22:59.049 --> 00:23:04.710
And to truly understand how broken this is,
well let’s just imagine you or I ate this

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:06.890
fruit and strolled up to Blackbeard.

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:13.460
Well, of course there is no way we would ever
beat the Emperor in a fight, but using the

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:20.360
fruit we could make it so that he has to play
a life and death game of Rock, Paper, Scissors,

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:23.890
where the loser is literally killed.

00:23:23.890 --> 00:23:30.460
Sure it might be a 50-50 chance, but it’s
infinitely better than having no chance at

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:31.730
all.

00:23:31.730 --> 00:23:35.760
Another perfect example is let’s say bounty
hunter Zoro came to collect the bounty on

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:36.760
your head.

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:41.200
Well, instead of fighting you simply challenge
him to a race through a maze and you will

00:23:41.200 --> 00:23:43.870
100% beat the always lost swordsman.

00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:52.320
So yeah, a truly broken ability, because with
its powers, even a normal person has a chance

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:55.270
to defeat the strongest characters in the
world.

00:23:55.270 --> 00:24:01.059
But if you truly want a cheat code to become
super powerful in One Piece, then there is

00:24:01.059 --> 00:24:06.140
nothing better you can do than eat one of
the Top Five actual devil fruits in One Piece,

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:09.720
and if you want to see exactly what those
broken devil fruits are, you can click this

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:10.990
video right here.

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:16.670
And again a huge shout out to everyone all
over the world who submitted.

00:24:16.670 --> 00:24:26.429
It was truly a blessing to see the huge variety
of countries represented in this community

00:24:26.429 --> 00:24:30.850
and I’m super excited to do this again soon.

00:24:30.850 --> 00:24:38.429
in fact, if you want to see 15 more fruits
from the almost 2000 submitted ones, let me

00:24:38.429 --> 00:24:44.859
know in the comments For now, Shanks for watching,
and I’ll see you in the next one.

